# Key material and secrets — never commit these.
# A passphrase-less private key sat in this folder during setup. It was never
# tracked, but nothing structural stopped `git add -A` from publishing it.
# These patterns are that missing control.
*.pem
*.key
*.ppk
*.p12
*.pfx
id_rsa
id_ecdsa
id_ed25519
id_*
*.pub
blueteamvault
blueteamvault.*
.env
.env.*
*.token
*_token
.netrc
_netrc

# Local build and working files
*.log
node_modules/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
